        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia okoirania chingencho chi’ogosasimwa koba chinyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Amatuko ayio onsi Amanene aerete, Abaisraeli bonsi abarenge aroro bakagenda ase emechie y’Abayuda bakanachana amatenenerio agosasimwa na bagatagora emete y’Asera, enyasae eria enkungu, naende bagasaria aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa. Boigo bagasaria kegima ebisasimero biarenge agwo ase orogongo rwonsi rw’Abayuda, na orw’Ababenjamini, na orw’Abaefraimu, na orw’Abamanase. Erio Abaisraeli bonsi bakairana gochia ase emechie yabo, kera omonto akagenda bwoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akairania abakuani na Abalawi, akabaroberia ase ebiombe. Kera oyomo obo akabeekwa ase ekeombe kiaye koreng’ana nemeremo yaye arenge gokora. Bakabeekwa korua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa na ebi’omorembe, na gokora emeremo agwo ase ebiita bi’egetwori ki’Omonene, naende ase ogoaka ng’a mbuya mono ase Omonene na komotogia namatera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akarua korwa ase chitugo chiaye ching’iti chiare koruegwa ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, ebia mambia na ebia mogoroba, na ebie Chisabato, na ebi’Emetienyi Emeyia, na ebi’Amatuko Amanene ande achiikire ase amachiiko ’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende agachiika abanto abamenyete Yerusalemu barue ebing’wanso ebi’Abakuani n’Abalawi bachikeretwe koegwa, erinde barabwo banyare kwerua ase obokoreri bw’amachiiko ’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli baigwete amang’ana omorwoti achigete, bakaba abaango korenta okwama kw’eritang’ani gwe chindagera, na okw’edivai, na okw’amaguta ’amazeituni, na okw’amooke, na okwama konde gwonsi kw’emegondo. Boigo bakarenta ensemo ya ikomi ya kera egento ase obonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli na Abayuda, baria bamenyete ase emechie y’Abayuda, bakarenta ensemo ya ikomi ye chiombe na eye ching’ondi, ebinto baatananete ase Omonene, Nyasae obo; ebio bakabibeka amo, bikaba ebinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omotienyi o gatato bagachaaka korenta ebiegwa ebio, na abakuani bakagenderera kobichoka goika ase omotienyi o gatano na kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Hezekia amo nabagaambi barenge ase oborwoti bwaye bachete bakarora ebinge biria, bagatogia Omonene na Abaisraeli, abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akaboria abakuani na Abalawi igoro ye ebinge biria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Asaria, Omokuani omonene, oria orenge bw’enyomba ya Zadoki, akamoiraneria, “Korwa riria abanto bachaagete korenta okoruegwa kwabo ase enyomba y’Omonene, intwe twabeire tokoria endagera eisaine, naende twatigairie enyinge mono. Intwe nigo tobwate ebinto ebio bionsi biatigaire, ekiagera Omonene asesenirie abanto baye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Hezekia agachiika abanto baagache ebigachero ase enyomba y’Omonene. Na ekero babiagachete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaba bakorenta ase obwegenwa ensemo yabo ya ikomi, amo n’ebinto biatananetwe ase Omonene. Konania Omolawi nere orenge omoteneneri bw’ebinto ebio, na Simei, omomura omwabo, nere orenge omokonyi oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yehieli na Asasia, Nahati na Asaeli, Yerimoti na Yosabadi, Elieli na Isimakia, Mahati na Benaya, abwo nabwo barenge abakoonyi ba Konania na Simei, momura omwabo. Nigo bachoretwe na Hezekia omorwoti na Asaria oyo otenenerete enyomba ya Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kore, mosinto o Imuna Omolawi, nigo arenge omorendi bw’egeita ki’ensemo ya moocha. Nere otenenerete ebiegwa bi’ogwancha biare koruegwa ase Nyasae; nigo arenge gwatanana ebiaruetwe ase Omonene amo nebiegwa biarenge ebichenu mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edeni na Miniamini, Yesua na Semaya, Amaria na Sekania, aba nabwo barenge abegenwa ase okomokonya ase emechie y’abakuani. Barabwo bakaba bagwatanana ebiegwa ebio ase abanto bamwabo, abagotu na abake, koreng’ana nebiombe biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nayio bagaatananera abana abamura b’emiaka etato na goetania ebiegwa, abwo baabarirwe na korikwa. Naende bagaatananera abwo babegetwe gokora emeremo yaganeirie ase enyomba y’Omonene kera rituko, koreng’ana nemeroberio y’ebiombe biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoroberio bw’ebiombe bi’abakuani nigo origetwe kobwatekana ne chiamate chiabo; na aba b’Abalawi barenge nemiaka emerongo ebere na goetania bakarikwa kobwatekana nemeremo ase ebiombe biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani nigo barigetwe amo ne chiamate chiabo chionsi, abana babo abake, na abakungu babo, na abana babo abamura na abaiseke, ekiagera nigo baganeirie koba abachenegete na babe bagokora emeremo yabo ase obwegenwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase egati y’abakuani b’ororeria rwa Aroni, abamenyete ase amaremo aetanaine emechie yabo, ase kera omochie, abanto gete bagachorwa na korikwa amarieta abo. Barabwo bakaba bagwatanana ebiegwa biria ase kera omonto omosacha, ase egati y’abakuani, na ase kera Omolawi origetwe ase omooroberio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio naro Hezekia akorete ase ense yonsi y’Abayuda; agakora ayare amaya na amaronge, na ay’obwegenwa ase obosio bw’Omonene, Nyasae oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agasesenigwa, ekiagera emeremo ende yonsi akorete ase enyomba ya Nyasae, ase okobwata amachiiko onsi, na komorigia Nyasae oye, nigo ayakorete nenkoro yaye yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
